# The rendered icon theme under hicolor/ is committed (cably/linux/make-icons.sh writes it;
# the build and the CI checkout need no renderer).  KiCad's root .gitignore ignores *.png
# for its generated bitmaps; this deeper file re-includes ours (cably/tests/linux-ci.sh (d)
# fails when a rendered icon is not tracked).
!*.png
